  "about": "The self-hosted font subsets (DESIGN.md section 3.4; spine section 10.2): each file pinned by SHA-256 and counted against GATE-bundle's budgets, each source pinned by URL and SHA-256, each face under the SIL Open Font License with its license file beside the subsets. Each face is a core file and an extension file with unicode-range, so a page downloads the extension only when it sets one of its characters. Written by scripts/spikes/W1-T01/build-fonts.mjs; never edited by hand. GATE-stamps checks every file's hash, and that tokens.css declares exactly these files with these ranges.",
